      </div>
      <div class="tip-box" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4caf50; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">The right progression</p>
        <p class="body-text">If you are testing a concept with zero budget: print-on-demand. If you have validated demand and are ready to build a real brand: bulk white label. If your brand identity depends on design ownership: private label. These are not competing options — they are sequential stages for a growing brand.</p>
