<!-- ═══ FAQ ═══ -->
<section style="padding: 5.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #111;">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="label">Questions</p>
    <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom: 3rem; max-width: 500px;">White label manufacturing — what buyers ask</h2>
    <div style="max-width: 800px;">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 style="font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">What exactly is white label clothing manufacturing?</h3>
        <p class="body-text">The factory produces pre-designed styles. You apply your brand labels and packaging. No design development. The trade-off: same styles available to other buyers — no design exclusivity. Best for market testing and fast launch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 style="font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">White label vs private label — which should I choose?</h3>
        <p class="body-text">White label: faster (20–30 days), lower cost, no design phase, no exclusivity. Private label: slower (55–70 days), higher cost, custom design, exclusively yours. Market testing → white label. Building a long-term differentiated brand → private label.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 style="font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">What is the MOQ?</h3>
        <p class="body-text">300 pieces per style. Flexible size distribution within that total (e.g. 50 XS / 100 S / 100 M / 50 L). Applies per style — a 2-style order requires 600 pieces minimum.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 style="font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">How fast is production?</h3>
        <p class="body-text">20–30 days from order confirmation to FOB-ready goods. No sampling phase. Faster than private label (40–45 days) because styles are pre-approved. Add ocean freight to your destination (20–35 days depending on port).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 style="font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">What customisation is possible?</h3>
        <p class="body-text">Labels (woven neck, hem, care), hang tags, poly bag packaging, and colour selection from available colourways. Construction, silhouette, and fabric are fixed per style. Changes to construction or fabric = private label territory.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 style="font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">Do certifications apply to white label orders?</h3>
        <p class="body-text">Yes — all 13 certifications apply to every order, including white label. GOTS and OEKO-TEX transaction certificates issued per order for certified styles. BSCI and SEDEX documentation available for retailer onboarding.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

